WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
Wendy: Whoa! I got a star! What did I do?

2
00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:07.600
Dingo: You put an onion in the pot. Stars tell you 'that was good, do it again!'

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.768
Kai: Um... so if I want more stars, I do more of that?

4
00:00:12.168 --> 00:00:14.472
Dingo: Exactly. That's called a reward.
